_:n007630702c974dd6a0f5ddd8e453d887b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be either rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, rml:UnsafeURI, rml:Literal, or rml:BlankNode for a Term Map.\n        May only be provided once.\n        " .
_:nafad668ee23a48abb87816caa74adc34b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:nafad668ee23a48abb87816caa74adc34b3 .
