<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Iterable must specify how to generate logical iterations on a data source.\r\n    " .
_:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicate> .
_:ncbd3169c64604a72bac3cb897a8cb55fb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:targetFields property must be specified for each rml:InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/leftJoin> .
_:nf9387b010f6d42aa81ba4baea4d4ab77b4 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A property for indicating whether a term map is a constant-valued term \n        map.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/FieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Field" .
_:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b2 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Reference Object Map.\n    " .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b31 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b32 .
_:nf9387b010f6d42aa81ba4baea4d4ab77b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A reference rml:reference is used to refer to a column in case of \n        databases, a record in case of CSV or TSV data source, an element in \n        case of XML data source, an object in case of a JSON data source, etc.\n\n        A reference must be a valid identifier, considering the reference \n        formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) specified. The reference can be\n        an absolute path, or a path relative to the iterator specified at the \n        logical source. \n        " .
_:na96297fe8c1f40e698ea7c73897a5807b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentMap> .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
