<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LogicalViewJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LogicalViewJoin" .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A logical source is any source that is mapped to RDF triples.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Triples Map requires exactly one rml:subject or one rml:subjectMap and zero\n    or more rml:predicateObjectMaps.\n    " .
_:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:predicate must be an IRI and be provided once.\n        " .
_:na96297fe8c1f40e698ea7c73897a5807b12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:n87a1ac55579a4a22ad0e701389999da0b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n87a1ac55579a4a22ad0e701389999da0b3 .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b31 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateMap> .
_:nf9387b010f6d42aa81ba4baea4d4ab77b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#BlankNodeOrIRI> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b1 .
