_:nc17e127e6aea462f898838cf129cfb05b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        A child field of the field.\r\n        " .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/FieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    A field is a construct that gives a name to data derived from an abstract logical source.\r\n    " .
