_:n2d706768b4c24a869f9c903f9d3639d1b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/field> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GraphMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Term Map is an Expression Map with optionally a term type specified.\n    " .
_:n3c039d0b607b49dcb3cd7aff7c27af4db1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:SubjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
_:n8b2271f1f6364c9facfa21578622633cb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n8b2271f1f6364c9facfa21578622633cb5 .
_:n007630702c974dd6a0f5ddd8e453d887b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
_:nf9387b010f6d42aa81ba4baea4d4ab77b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:n3c039d0b607b49dcb3cd7aff7c27af4db6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/graph> .
_:n6840d70779ec4bc7b27531132373c608b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A PredicateMap element to generate the predicate component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b25 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/field> .
