<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Graph Map.\n    " .
_:n2dbd8fad76de4729bad093ab4c59bcb8b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "template/constant/reference" .
_:n25d950c00cbf488fb79b062967955090b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be an rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI, rml:URI,\n        rml:UnsafeURI, or rml:BlankNode for a Graph Map.\n        " .
