<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Predicate Object Map.\n    " .
_:ncc4f6af6c9c1437fab4febbd76ce0e8eb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:strategy specifies the collection strategy to use: rml:append\n        or rml:cartesianProduct. rml:append is the default strategy.\n        " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b7 .
