_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An IRI reference for use as subject for all generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/viewOn> .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b35 .
_:n007630702c974dd6a0f5ddd8e453d887b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/URI> .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Every rml:InclusionAnnotation (or rml:ForeignKeyAnnotation) targeting this view via rml:targetView must also specify exactly one rml:targetFields property.\n        " .
_:Nb2fc4f4cad1640f4b813ba4715e5f513 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:ncc4f6af6c9c1437fab4febbd76ce0e8eb8 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        RML Term Maps to gather in the collection or container.\n        " .
_:Nad8ca21969a04a0ca0ae68352a53f887 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N16afc102ba504e6083d9a45dccd7a2eb .
_:n007630702c974dd6a0f5ddd8e453d887b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n007630702c974dd6a0f5ddd8e453d887b3 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:Join must specify exactly one rml:parent/rml:parentMap \n    and rml:child/rml:childMap.\n    " .
_:n75b16c9405c84686937c146bafc5266bb9 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Language tag for the object.\n        " .
