_:n2d706768b4c24a869f9c903f9d3639d1b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        A leaf expression field is an expression field without nested fields.\r\n        " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:logicalSource is required to access the data source.\n        " .
_:nc17e127e6aea462f898838cf129cfb05b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:fieldName property must be specified for a rml:Field, with a string as its value.\r\n        " .
_:ncbd3169c64604a72bac3cb897a8cb55fb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:targetView property must be specified for each rml:InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b33 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapORPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n75b16c9405c84686937c146bafc5266bb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/datatypeMap> .
_:ncc4f6af6c9c1437fab4febbd76ce0e8eb7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:ExpressionField description.\r\n    " .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b26 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Two distinct fields in this view's effective field set (its own fields plus any introduced by leftJoin/innerJoin) share the same rml:fieldName." .
_:Nc13e96810bdc4a68819debde3b6ffd34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentMap> .
