_:nc17e127e6aea462f898838cf129cfb05b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        The value of a rml:field property for a rml:Field must be a resource.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Node must have a valid rml:LogicalView description.\n    rml:LogicalView requires\n    - exactly one rml:viewOn property, with a rml:AbstractLogicalSource as its value.\n    - at least one rml:field property, with a rml:Field as its value.\n    " .
_:n8a26e9359539456ebf3fa6bffa3cf1bcb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGatherMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Gather Map requires one rml:strategy, one rml:gatherAs, and a list of\n    Term Map with rml:gather.\n    " .
_:nc17e127e6aea462f898838cf129cfb05b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        The name of the field.\r\n        " .
_:na96297fe8c1f40e698ea7c73897a5807b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:parentMap must point to a rml:ParentMap specifying the \n        parent tag of the string Literal.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StructuralAnnotation" .
