_:n8a26e9359539456ebf3fa6bffa3cf1bcb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the Triples Map element corresponding to the parent data\n        source of the foreign key constraint.\n        " .
_:nc17e127e6aea462f898838cf129cfb05b10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/IterableFieldShape> .
_:ne36ac4c0aca6448fb37517974a22ecc4b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
_:nc52e49f8f7b24f3d99a1f2f86c3cbfa1b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
